The code imports only the archived D1 and Gph one-dimensional symbols. It does
not import scripts/f1_lib.py or scripts/f4_lib.py. Vertices are obtained by
explicit enumeration of the six axis orders and all legs; seagulls are obtained
from pairwise path-current products rather than f4_lib.py's closed corner sums.
